From: omesh <roland@nordhain.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 2026 19:59:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/41] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20clippy=20lints=20=E2=80=94=20unnec?=
 =?UTF-8?q?essary=20qualifications=20+=20trivial=20cast=20in=20get=5Fhashe?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20DIRECT-BULK?=
